   "title": "「第6回川口花火大会」開催が決定！今年は11月14日(土)！",
   "html": "\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" src=\"https://kawaguchi-magazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/IMG_5720-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"第5回川口花火大会\" class=\"wp-image-137306\" srcset=\"https://kawaguchi-magazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/IMG_5720-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://kawaguchi-magazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/IMG_5720-300x169.jpg 300w, https://kawaguchi-magazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/IMG_5720-768x432.jpg 768w, https://kawaguchi-magazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/IMG_5720.jpg 1200w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">第6回川口花火大会が開催が決定！今年は、11月14日(土)！</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">公式サイトに<a href=\"https://1110hanabi.com/news/20260701/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">お知らせ</a>が出ていましたよ！</p>\n\n\n\n<pre class=\"wp-block-preformatted\"><span class=\"p-adBox\" data-id=\"171577\" data-ad=\"text\"><!-- 川口マガジン記事内広告(記事が長い時用） -->\r\n<ins class=\"adsbygoogle\" style=\"display: block;\" data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-9536204880251377\" data-ad-slot=\"1886236620\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\"></ins>\r\n<script>\r\n     (adsbygoogle = window.adsbygoogle || []).push({});\r\n</script></span></pre>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">観覧席チケットは　<strong>8月17日（月）10:00から［CNプレイガイド］にて発売予定</strong>　とのこと。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">詳細は随時、川口花火大会<a href=\"https://1110hanabi.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">公式サイト</a>に情報が公開されるみたいですよ。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">昨年は10月の開催で、今年は11月に戻るんだ〜！今年も楽しみ〜！！！</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">昨年の様子はこちらの記事をどうぞ↓</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-wp-embed\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://kawaguchi-magazine.com/archives/137251\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"rtoc-5\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">川口市の話題</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">&#x25b6;川口マガジンの<a href=\"https://x.com/kawaguchi_maga\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">X</a>と<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/kawaguchi_magazine/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">インスタ</a>ぜひフォローしてね！</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-wp-embed\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://kawaguchi-magazine.com/archives/172334\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-wp-embed\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://kawaguchi-magazine.com/archives/171768\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-wp-embed\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://kawaguchi-magazine.com/archives/171596\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-wp-embed\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://kawaguchi-magazine.com/archives/172345\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-wp-embed\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://kawaguchi-magazine.com/archives/172343\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-wp-embed\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://kawaguchi-magazine.com/archives/172322\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-wp-embed\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://kawaguchi-magazine.com/archives/172233\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-wp-embed\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://kawaguchi-magazine.com/archives/172191\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-wp-embed\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://kawaguchi-magazine.com/archives/171396\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">■川口マガジンでは皆さまからの情報提供をお待ちしています！投稿いただいた方の中から毎月4名様に500円のアマゾンギフトをプレゼント。<br>→<a href=\"https://kawaguchi-magazine.com/otoiawase\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">情報提供フォームへ</a>。</p>\n\n\n<a href=\"\" class=\"blog-card\"><div class=\"blog-card-hl-box\"><i class=\"jic jin-ifont-post\"></i><span class=\"blog-card-hl\"></span></div><div class=\"blog-card-box\"><div class=\"blog-card-thumbnail\"></div><div class=\"blog-card-content\"><span class=\"blog-card-title\"></span><span class=\"blog-card-excerpt\"></span></div></div></a><a href=\"\" class=\"blog-card\"><div class=\"blog-card-hl-box\"><i class=\"jic jin-ifont-post\"></i><span class=\"blog-card-hl\"></span></div><div class=\"blog-card-box\"><div class=\"blog-card-thumbnail\"></div><div class=\"blog-card-content\"><span class=\"blog-card-title\"></span><span class=\"blog-card-excerpt\"></span></div></div></a><a href=\"\" class=\"blog-card\"><div class=\"blog-card-hl-box\"><i class=\"jic jin-ifont-post\"></i><span class=\"blog-card-hl\"></span></div><div class=\"blog-card-box\"><div class=\"blog-card-thumbnail\"></div><div class=\"blog-card-content\"><span class=\"blog-card-title\"></span><span class=\"blog-card-excerpt\"></span></div></div></a>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://kawaguchi-magazine.com/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"196\" src=\"https://kawaguchi-magazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/kawamaga-kaiyubanar1-1024x196.jpg\" alt=\"川口マガジン｜毎日6記事\" class=\"wp-image-147700\" srcset=\"https://kawaguchi-magazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/kawamaga-kaiyubanar1-1024x196.jpg 1024w, https://kawaguchi-magazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/kawamaga-kaiyubanar1-300x58.jpg 300w, https://kawaguchi-magazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/kawamaga-kaiyubanar1-768x147.jpg 768w, https://kawaguchi-magazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/kawamaga-kaiyubanar1.jpg 1200w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n<p><!-- 川口マガジン記事内広告(記事が長い時用） --><br />\n<ins class=\"adsbygoogle\" style=\"display: block;\" data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-9536204880251377\" data-ad-slot=\"1886236620\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\"></ins><br />\n<script><br />\n     (adsbygoogle = window.adsbygoogle || []).push({});<br />\n</script></p>\n\n\n<p class=\"has-swl-pale-01-background-color has-background wp-block-paragraph\">●川口マガジンTwitterは<a href=\"https://twitter.com/kawaguchi_maga\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">こちら。</a><br>●川口マガジン公式インスタグラムは<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/kawaguchi_magazine/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">こちら。</a><br>●川口マガジンfacebookは<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/kawaguchimagazine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">こちら。</a><br>●川口マガジンのオススメ記事が週1回LINEに届く！登録は<a href=\"https://page.line.me/oa-kawaguchimaga\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">こちら。</a></p>\n"
