   "title": "アリオ川口で「お子様縁日」があるみたい！4/11・12",
   "html": "\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"https://kawaguchi-magazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/IMG_6144-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-147922\" srcset=\"https://kawaguchi-magazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/IMG_6144-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https://kawaguchi-magazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/IMG_6144-300x225.jpg 300w, https://kawaguchi-magazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/IMG_6144-768x576.jpg 768w, https://kawaguchi-magazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/IMG_6144.jpg 1200w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">アリオ川口で「お子様縁日」が、4月11日(土)・12日(日)に開催されるみたい！</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">公式サイトに<a href=\"https://kawaguchi.ario.jp/event/1700011471/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">お知らせ</a>が出ていましたよ！</p>\n\n\n\n<!-- 川口マガジン記事内広告(記事が長い時用） -->\n<ins class=\"adsbygoogle\" style=\"display: block;\" data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-9536204880251377\" data-ad-slot=\"1886236620\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\"></ins>\n<script>\n     (adsbygoogle = window.adsbygoogle || []).push({});\n</script>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">アリオ川口<a href=\"https://kawaguchi.ario.jp/event/1700011471/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">公式サイト</a>によると、千本つりやスーパーボールすくい、射的など、みんな大好きな縁日が楽しめるみたい！</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">料金は、各種目400円とのこと。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">時間は10:00〜17:00(最終受付16:45)で、場所は2Fセンターコート。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">詳しくは<a href=\"https://kawaguchi.ario.jp/event/1700011471/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">こちら</a>をどうぞ。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">室内で縁日気分が味わえるのは、子供も喜びそうだ〜♪</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">川口市の話題</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">&#x25b6;川口マガジンの<a href=\"https://x.com/kawaguchi_maga\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">X</a>と<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/kawaguchi_magazine/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">インスタ</a>ぜひフォローしてね！</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-wp-embed\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://kawaguchi-magazine.com/archives/156986\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-wp-embed\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://kawaguchi-magazine.com/archives/156533\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-wp-embed\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://kawaguchi-magazine.com/archives/156989\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-wp-embed\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://kawaguchi-magazine.com/archives/156981\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-wp-embed\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://kawaguchi-magazine.com/archives/156901\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-wp-embed\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://kawaguchi-magazine.com/archives/156481\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-wp-embed\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://kawaguchi-magazine.com/archives/155488\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-wp-embed\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://kawaguchi-magazine.com/archives/156883\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-wp-embed\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://kawaguchi-magazine.com/archives/156792\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">■川口マガジンでは皆さまからの情報提供をお待ちしています！投稿いただいた方の中から毎月4名様に500円のアマゾンギフトをプレゼント。<br>→<a href=\"https://kawaguchi-magazine.com/otoiawase\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">情報提供フォームへ</a>。</p>\n\n\n<a href=\"https://kawaguchi-magazine.com/archives/157019\" class=\"blog-card\"><div class=\"blog-card-hl-box\"><i class=\"jic jin-ifont-post\"></i><span class=\"blog-card-hl\"></span></di